I just LOVE this Dustbuster.  I had a previous model by Black & Decker, but this one is MUCH better.  PLUS....and this is a BIG plus, you can wash the filters!!!  I have two parakeets and use this to clean up seeds and other 'messies' from them.  SO....the filters get clogged at times with small seeds, feathers, etc.  I just twist them off, separate them, spray some cleaner on them, and wash them very well under a strong blast of hot water with my bath tub faucet....I even use a fingernail brush on the hard plastic one and it cleans out the tiny holes.  I just let them dry, and it cleans like it is NEW. It will also go for 3 or 4 days with using it off and on every day without having to put it back on the charger. When/IF this every goes out on me, I WILL buy THIS model again!
