<review_text>
These are the utensils I grew up with... and I inherited an almost complete set from my parents when I moved out a couple years ago.  My parents just keep buying more and more place settings to replace the inevitable lost or thrown away utensil, and I doubt they will ever buy something different as long as oneida is making them.  They clean easily in the dishwasher or in the sink.  They are very hefty and the large soup spoons even hold up to scooping of the most stubborn ice cream.  I just ordered a set of the &quot;sand dune&quot; pattern only because I need a change of pace.  I'll keep these around as backups to pass on to my kids
</review_text>
