This is a great bookcase for the money.  I needed a book shelf and desk for our den and did not want to spend a lot of money.  The Dolce collection was perfect in color, size and price!  Everything matches nicely and the stain is a lovely rich color.  The only &amp;amp;quot;cheap&amp;amp;quot; part is that the back of the book shelf consists of a thin piece of press board that you tack on with small nails.  However, because the color matches the wood, it is hardly noticeable.  I definately reccomend this and the desk too.  The whole line is great if you want that rich wood look for a bargain price
