<review_text>
You could spend a lot more &quot;dough&quot; on an expensive pizza stone, but this metal pizza crisper did a wonderful job - especially considering  the price.  I cook often and Italian is my specialty.  I was very impressed  with this metal pizza rack. I like my homemade crusts thin and slightly  crispy.  While the secret is always said to be in the dough, I think the  air vents on the bottom of this pan help to make my pizza crust just  perfect.  It's also a great pan to use on those nights when I don't have  time to let my dough rise and just want to pop a frozen pizza into the  oven.  It's also great for warming left overs
</review_text>
</review>
