</reviewer_location>
<review_text>
I am assuming that the person who wrote the review dated January 3, 2004 ("A Kitchen & Housewares enthusiast") was reviewing a different item by Caphalon.  She/he mentioned rust, and these pans are aluminum according to the description above.  Either Amazon is mistaken about these pans being aluminum (could they be aluminized steel??) OR the reviewer on 1/3/04 posted her review with the wrong item.   

I am guessing that she/he bought other non-stick Caphalon pans -- perhaps the "Simply Caphalon" pans which are steel.  Since Caphalon has multiple lines of pans, made of different metals, people need to be careful when typing in a review.  I am still trying to figure out which pans to buy, and now I don't know whether I can depend on the reviews to be for the correct item.
</review_text>
</review>
