</title>
<date>
May 12, 2004
</date>
<reviewer>
audrey copenhagen
</reviewer>
<reviewer_location>
Redlands, CA United States
</reviewer_location>
<review_text>
My sister gave us all these for Christmas 1 1/2 years ago; she was on a trip to London and got them at Harrod's. We had (2) and (1) disappeared to who-knows-where and I've been looking for more ever since. I LOVE these coolers and was THRILLED to find them at Amazon today. Freeze them, put your canned drink in for a few minutes &amp; it's icy cold &amp; you're ready to roll! I live near the desert and always grab a drink on my way out the door and these are perfect!! ENJOY!
</review_text>
</review>
