Wow, what can I say I just bought this vaccum today.  Well I did a test with my old vacuum an Eureka, and the Dyson.  I vacuumed 1 room twice with the Eureka and it picked up some dirt and dog(German Shepherd)hair.  Then I used the Dyson, I could not believe the dog hair and dirt that the Dyson picked up after using the Eureka.  I will tell you, my wife is very happy with this Dyson so far(1 night).  I was amazed at all the dog hair it picked up.  Normally after using the old vacuum you could always see dog hair left on the carpet.  With the Dyson it picks every hair up.  We are very happy with the purchase.  We bought it at Bed Bath & Beyond 499.99 - 20% coupon = 400.00 - what a deal. 
