</reviewer_location>
<review_text>
I CONSTANTLY RECEIVE TRAVEL MUGS AS GIFTS & THEY NEVER SEEM TO
WORK AS WELL AS THE BODUM I HAVE. I DO NOT HAVE ANY SPILL OR LEAK PROBLEMS. THIS MUG FITS INTO MY CAR & MY WIFE'S CAR WITHOUT 
ANY PROBLEMS. I USE IT FOR COLD DRINKS AS WELL AS HOT & IT KEEPS THEM THAT WAY FOR A LONG, LONG TIME.
AT 9 AM , I LEFT MY HOUSE FOR A MEETING WITH A FEW ICE CUBES & A DIET COKE. WHEN I RETURNED TO THE VEHICLE AT 2 PM, THE ICE CUBES
WERE STILL IN THE MUG & ONLY SLIGHTLY MELTED. 

I EXPERIENCE THE SAME RESULT WITH HOT COFFEE. 

THE PART I LOVE THE MOST ABOUT IT - IS THAT I CAN THROW IT IN THE DISHWASHER & IT NOT WORRY ABOUT IT AT ALL. NOT JUST THE STAINLESS STEEL BUT THE RUBBER HOLDER & LID HAVE HELD UP OVER 3 YEARS NOW. I AM ON-LINE NOW BUYING ANOTHER ONE TO GIVE TO A CUSTOMER. 
</review_text>
</review>
