<review_text>
This is a small, yet sturdy and powerful hand vacuum. By far the best I have tried from B&D. It has successfully helped us to get rid of fiber carpet and dirt in our place. Great alternative to a full upright vacuum cleaner. I had doubts between this cleaner and the small, corded, yellow Eureka hand vacuum, but I am glad we went for this choice instead. It is not heavy, and it is certainly powerful enough to get dust, dirt and fiber out of very stepped-on carpets and rugs, not to say vinyl floors, where it can pick-up almost anything on them. This is not to be used to pick-up wet stuff. It did require a full 16 hour charge before it had enough power to be useful, and at full speed, it will hold for a full 13-17 minutes
