</reviewer_location>
<review_text>
After 10 years of use very day, my old Black and Decker Food Steamer died. Since B & D doesn't seem to make large capacity steamers any more, I opted for this Oster model. A lot has changed in 10 years and Oster seems to have packed some pretty wonderful features into the 5712.  It cooks food a lot faster than my old B & D; I suspect because the holes at the bottom of the tray are larger so the food steam cooks more quickly and because the heating element is newer and more efficient.  It's very easy to clean and put back together for future use. I am very impressed by the self timer and the keep-warm features.  They are both very easy to program. Buy this at TARGET for $29.95.  It's the exact model for a lot less money and no shipping charges. 
</review_text>
</review>
