<review_text>
After seeing the negative reviews, I had to share my experience because I find these containers so useful.  Like the other positive reviewers, I did not get mine from Organize Everything, and I wonder if they are the probelm here...  I've had my Lock & Locks for a few years.  I use the same two little boxes for lunch almost every day, and they seal as tightly now as when they were new.  Soups don't leak - ever.  Even the most highly-staining foods (spicy red sauces, blueberry or cranberry compotes) wash right out without staining.  I get a few more every few months and use them for more and more.  They are a Korean import; perhaps you can find them at a Korean grocery or import shop and get a great product without the bad experience that these other folks have had
</review_text>
</review>
