</title>
<date>
June 6, 2003
</date>
<reviewer>
"endoftheroad"
</reviewer>
<reviewer_location>
MN, USA
</reviewer_location>
<review_text>
I manage a retail store.  I wanted to rate this product with 5 stars.  I rated it with 1 star.  Reason why I wanted to rate it a 5 is because of the many uses it has.  It is very handy for our big display windows and the smaller areas where you can't get a vacuum in.  Very portable and great attachments.  The main reason it got 1 star is the fact I have to throw away a perfectly good DustBuster because I can't replace the batteries.  The batteries don't seem to hold there charge after a year of use.  We do wear the battery completely out and recharge it once in a while.  This helps any rechargable batteries life extension.  I am not going to buy another Black &amp; Decker, or any other DustBuster that I can't replace the batteries in.  It's a waste of money and adds to the useless waste in the world.  Until I find something else, I will use the plug-in vacuum we have to replace once every 4 to 5 years.  Less waste and cheaper
</review_text>
</review>
