I recently purchased this knife and am overjoyed with the performance. If you don't have a well balanced professional knife you can't imagine how nice it is to work with one. I went to the local restaurant supply stores  and handled several brands and sizes to see what felt best. The Henckels  Pro S 8&quot; was the best. The 10&quot; seemed top heavy but I'm sure  someone else may feel different.    The blade holds an incredible edge as  well. I steel the blade before each use to keep the edge in the best  cutting condition
