Look, want to make really lean ground meat?  A minichopper should do that, right? You buy a slab of pork or beef that's low in marbling, cut it into cubes and this should make you ground meat.  Well, it'll jam, even if you only put 3 or 4 cubes in it.&#60;br /&#62;
